PK␀␀␀␀␀␀␀P]P,€·∂␀␀∂␀␀Å␀␀␀continuous_wallet_D_compact_code_generated_saved6_recovery_20261016_v3/source/continuous_wallet_D_generated_20261015_v1/README.md# Continuous-wallet D comparison: generated implementation only

Status: GENERATED SCAFFOLD. Historical source and financial public entry points deliberately raise PermissionError. Nothing here admits actual source bodies, constructs a historical account, creates a financial claim, accepts an annual GO, resumes a wallet, downloads data, reads holdouts or publishes anything. Old artifacts remain unchanged.

The fixed future question is original intrinsic STATIC50_OLD_NO_REEXPANSION versus CORE VOL_MANAGED_HOLD, each at LOW/MID/HIGH. Every fixed account starts once with 10,000 USDT. Actual intended calendar is [2021-04-02, 2026-01-01), 1,735 days / 2,498,400 opens, entirely seen DEV. The nominal tiers do not imply matched realized risk. No half-SMA arm, outcome selection or new held-risk controller is added.

## What is implemented

- continuous_source.py: generated-only live-sealed immutable inputs; exact float64 overlap/endpoint, contiguous minute partition and literal funding validators; both unchanged original target builders; byte-exact annual target/covariance and complete causal-proof parity; a metadata-only declaration check against the frozen historical pins. No genuine array/container is read.
- continuous_native.py: one account, simulator, provider and funding cursor over the global window. All finance, Guard50, no-transfer, capital, lot, partial/replacement, latency and native terminal60 method bodies are reused. Only class/type binding, metadata, source transport and quality composition are additive. Typed carried cells and later interval witnesses are combined with an OR predicate; each interval has its own genuine anchor.
- continuous_saved.py: immutable, fsynced minute chunks, atomically replaced prefix checkpoints and pure annual markers after native mark/funding/risk. Checkpoints record quantities, NAV, cash/margin/debt, pending IDs/ages/attempts, prior quote, funding cursor/ownership, quality, lifetime peak and financial sequence. They are observation evidence, never restart snapshots or financial terminals. Validation binds caller identity/calendar, exact chunk names/bytes/schema and every internal Jan 1.
- run_generated.py: bounded one-to-31-day invented native runs through the real output writer, full native result conversion, chronological native40 proof, risk reporting and gzip JSON exact round-trip verification. Canonical daily chunks are compared byte-for-byte to the native result. A duplicate whole-minute archive is not written. All writes reserve 1.5 GB free disk. Actual finance/controller/claims are absent.

Generated clocks use 1970‚Äì1975, outside the historical/holdout namespace. The full source projection has 1,934 feature rows and 1,735 decisions; its leap day falls in a different internal year. Exact intended 2021‚Äì2025 partition lengths [274,365,365,366,365] are separately checked from declared metadata, and the output writer is tested with invented values over that exact intended calendar. These are generated tests, never historical economic results.

## Verification

AUTHOR_GENERATED_TESTS_FINAL.log records 15 passed tests. Coverage includes:

- all six fixed recipe/tier descriptors, one genesis and no financial alias/reuse
- full-horizon invented source/target/covariance/provenance parity, source mismatch/gap/overlap/duplicate/future negatives and future-suffix causality
- generated duck-type/forgery/revocation rejection, old-GO/generated-flag/resume denial and unchanged inherited finance methods
- cross-Jan-1 inventory, funding ownership/strict-prior marks, pending/prior-quote/peak/financial-sequence continuity and exact block-partition invariance
- both quality predicates, installed genuine recovery and late/future recovery rejection
- native Guard50 warning, protective retry renewal, cash depleted to about 500 USDT, coarse-lot inventory and paid sub-minimum DOGE close across a boundary
- ordinary five-opens expiry and final sixty-real-opens exhaustion, honest residual/non-paid return, no intermediate terminal or end-plus-one fill
- all 2,498,400 intended-calendar invented output rows in 1,735 durable chunks; immutable/reused/tampered output and incomplete-prefix rejection

The sibling independent review has its own guarded tests, initial bypass finding and correction verification. REFERENCE_CODE_GRAPH_VERIFICATION.json rehashes the immutable inherited Python code graph only. DECLARED_HISTORICAL_METADATA_ONLY.json explicitly leaves genuine source continuity and genuine target parity unverified.

Run author checks using the existing supported environment:

    taskset -c 7 coin_partial_restore_20261014/.venv/bin/python -B continuous_wallet_D_generated_20261015_v1/test_continuous.py

Run one bounded invented output/resource probe, choosing a new output directory:

    taskset -c 7 coin_partial_restore_20261014/.venv/bin/python -B continuous_wallet_D_generated_20261015_v1/run_generated.py --cpu 7 --days 31 --tier HIGH --recipe STATIC50_OLD_NO_REEXPANSION --output <new-owned-generated-directory>

Numerical libraries are configured for one worker. Auxiliary jemalloc/Polars/Tokio threads exist, all pinned to the same CPU. This is not a claim of exactly one OS thread.

## Next gates

1. Separate exact source-only authorization and implementation/admission of genuine saved-body recapture/splice. Verify all five qualified source pins, product namespace, every overlap and native endpoint before constructing genuine targets. Do not fix disagreements by precedence, tolerance or download.
2. Independently verify genuine union-built targets/covariances/provenance against every saved annual preparation, including original 2022 quality anchors and later 2024 recovery evidence. No generated result establishes this.
3. Explicitly decide revised resource admission. RESOURCE_PROPOSAL.json is only a proposal based on measured short probes, exact raw telemetry size and declared stored month sizes. Short extrapolations do not prove full-horizon native/journal/export peaks. Root has explicitly replaced the full-horizon synthetic probe prerequisite with a serial first-account pilot under the accepted research resource bounds. Prelaunch admission requires at least 5.5 GB of the lower host/visible-cgroup available memory plus the 1.5 GB free-disk floor. This is no source or financial GO; completion counts once, and failure pauses the queue without automatic replay or reset.
4. Implement and independently review the actual continuous scope/loader/controller/claim/output terminal validator, then issue a new exact-code six-cell financial GO. Existing annual GO/review/claims cannot authorize this task. An interruption preserves prefix evidence and pauses the queue; there is no automatic replay, reseed, snapshot resume or paid-terminal inference.

No continuous-wallet performance claim has been made.
